 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Without the Male Lead, My Grades Are Doomed"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "My Grades Will Fall Without the Male Lead"
   },
   {
    "ko": "남주가 없으면 내 성적이 망한다"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "High school student Han Jiseo is perfectly happy to be reborn as an extra character in a manhwa. Her side character always scores second place in the entire school, after all! The male lead, Ju Yiwon, is welcome to first place; Jiseo's happy so long as she can get into university. But one day, Ju Yiwon doesn't come to school... and Jiseo scores zero on a test. \"Don't tell me... my grades depend on the male lead?!\" If Jiseo wants to make it to university, Ju Yiwon needs to be present. Thus begins Jiseo's ultimate mission: make sure the male lead attends school! (Summary adapted by me from Kakaopage.)"
  },
